# Local junk only ever seen on a developer's machine: build artifacts,
# editor leftovers, macOS resource forks, the scratch dumps the oracle runs
# produced.  Nothing here is part of the repo layout (DESIGN.md section 2.4).
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
._*
dmesg*
DESIGN.html
DESIGN.md~
rendered/
reference/build-tools/
reference/build-probes/
node_modules/
# This design's own build and gate artifacts (DESIGN-PYTHON.md 2.6 dist job,
# 4.7 coverage gate); none of it is shipped.
dist/
.coverage
.coverage.*
